SAFETY NOTICE

This project describes a measurement instrument that is intended to be
connected to voltages up to 615 V. It is NOT galvanically isolated. Building
or operating it incorrectly can destroy equipment and can kill you.

The design in this repository has been verified by simulation and static
analysis only. NO PHYSICAL BOARD HAS EVER BEEN BUILT OR MEASURED. Read
BELGELER/4-kurulum.html and uretim/_tezgah.md before building anything, and
treat every figure here as a design intent to be verified on the bench, not as
a measured result.

As stated above, the software is provided without warranty of any kind. That
disclaimer applies with particular force to the hardware design: you are
responsible for your own safety.

